  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Damage Tilt</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>Minecraft 版本 1.19.4 及以後不需要這個 mod！ <br></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">適用於 Forge 和 Fabric 1.14 - 1.19！<br></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">也提供 Forge 1.7.10、1.8.9、1.12.2 版本</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>點擊謫藏框以取得下載連結！</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">支援的 Minecraft 版本：<br></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>(Forge)<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-tilt/files/3097543\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.7.10</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-tilt/files/3096008\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.8.9</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-tilt/files/3073878\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.12.2</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-tilt/files/3077425\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.14.x</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-tilt/files/3077427\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.15.x</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-tilt/files/3077428\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.16.x</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-tilt/files/3598172\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.17.x</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-tilt/files/3598216\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.18.x</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-tilt/files/3937119\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.x</a></p>\n<p>(Fabric)<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-tilt/files/3198808\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.14.x</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-tilt/files/3198809\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.15.x</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-tilt/files/3198810\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.16.x</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-tilt/files/3347434\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.17.x<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-tilt/files/3548092\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.18.x<br></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-tilt/files/3841695\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.x</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>僅客戶端版本（供在沒有此 mod 的伺服器上遊玩）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>(Forge)<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-tilt/files/3429124\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.8.9</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>恢復一個長久遺忘的 Minecraft 功能：Damage Tilt!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>在 Minecraft 1.2.5 版本中，當您受傷時，相機角度會向受擊方向傾斜。</p>\n<p>這有助於您快速判斷傷害來源（這也是個很酷的效果）。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本 mod 恢復該功能——因為早在多年前的 Minecraft 1.3.1 更新後，此功能就被破壞了。</p>\n<p>mod 必須同時安裝在伺服器與客戶端才能運作。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這裡是一段快速演示影片。</p>\n<p>\"Before\" 是未安裝此 mod 的情況：您只會看到鏡頭向左或向右傾斜。</p>\n<p>\"After\" 是已安裝此 mod 的情況：您會看到鏡頭根據受擊位置呈現多角度傾斜。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QtKTuZRIKXs?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這是由 Shivaxi 製作的更詳細說明／示範影片：</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pAJPc71YOnY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
